# Canonical learning-note output layout under any selected output root
**/notes/[0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9]/[0-9][0-9]/[0-9][0-9]/

# Synthetic or explicitly approved redacted fixtures remain trackable.
!ClassHelperTests/Fixtures/**
!ClassHelperUITests/Fixtures/**
